that changes your tire pressure,
not just your tread.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Sunset's coming earlier.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Test your headlights and wipers
before the first foggy morning.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Fifteen-minute multi-point check,
no appointment needed.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — link in bio.
